  message: "Pass 13 evidence-strengthening: dangling-src edges break down by source NODE (not just file pseudo-node). 4 unique src IDs across 23 edges: (a) scip_pb2.py:1-1:file:file (10 edges — original QQQ case), (b) test_scip_generated.py:54-78:test_index_roundtrip:function (5 edges), (c) test_scip_generated.py:1-1:file:file (5 edges), (d) test_scip_generated.py:81-88:test_source_commit_file_is_pinned_sha:function (3 edges). 8 of 23 dangling edges originate from FUNCTION nodes (not file pseudo-nodes) — the test functions exist in source but were not emitted as nodes. This extends QQQ from 'phantom file pseudo-node' to 'phantom function nodes in tests of generated code'. The dangling pattern follows the generated/tested-generated boundary, not the file/function boundary."  # 21dd
